    1. priority_order
       Q: The priority_order field lists 'Throughput' three times instead of the actual KPI names (value_per_resource_consumed, operator_fatigue_index, ambient_noise_level). Which KPI should take precedence when feasibility forces a trade-off — e.g., if holding fatigue ≤ 0.4 forces a 15% efficiency drop, should fatigue always win?
