    3. operator_fatigue_index hard constraint vs. resource_efficiency maximize
       Q: If sustaining peak throughput intensity pushes the fatigue index to 0.4 within the first three hours of an 8-hour shift, should the optimizer throttle cycle rate to keep fatigue headroom for the full shift, or is it acceptable to run at the constraint boundary early and accept reduced output capacity in the latter half?
