      Preserves human constraints: Yes
    - Option 2: Add a Supplemental Weekend Shift (Voluntary): Introduce one voluntary weekend shift staffed by workers who opt in, compensated at premium rate. This can address up to 20% of the demand gap without altering weekday schedules. All standard human-centric constraints (rest intervals, consecutive-day limits, fatigue scoring) apply to the additional shift. Effectiveness depends on voluntary uptake rate; production manager should confirm workforce availability before committing.
