       Q: The assumptions list energy, raw materials, and direct labour hours as resources, but these have very different marginal costs and substitution rates — should the optimiser treat them as a weighted composite (e.g. monetary cost), optimise a single dominant resource (e.g. energy kWh), or respect separate sub-budgets for each category?
